# Real-time lanes and one compute job per tick (SPEC §22).
# `1 lc` asks for one pinned slot. Input `~m` sends 7, net `~n` sends 9.
# `^` queues a compute job. Each tick runs m, then n, then at most one job,
# so a queued job cannot skip a lane. `sg` is the trace.
1 lc
[ 7 | ] ~m
[ 9 | ] ~n
[ ] ^
3 rn
sg .
pm .
pn .
